WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.320
Episode 17

01:36.180 --> 01:37.540
Qin,

01:37.740 --> 01:39.030
where are you going?

01:39.050 --> 01:40.500
After Rong's death,

01:40.570 --> 01:42.260
I have no place to return to.

01:42.570 --> 01:43.930
I think

01:44.130 --> 01:45.780
I should find a temple

01:45.930 --> 01:47.440
and stay with the Buddha.

01:47.460 --> 01:48.370
Before I go,

01:48.390 --> 01:49.830
I want to say goodbye to you.

01:49.850 --> 01:51.210
Take care.

01:58.980 --> 02:00.340
Miss Jiang.

02:00.770 --> 02:01.960
The night is cold.

02:01.980 --> 02:03.350
Be careful not to catch a cold.

02:03.370 --> 02:04.630
Zhen,

02:04.650 --> 02:06.470
thanks to you coming in time,

02:06.490 --> 02:08.160
or Magistrate Jia would've certainly

02:08.180 --> 02:09.020
swept this case

02:09.020 --> 02:10.230
under the rug.

02:10.250 --> 02:12.400
Why the worried face then?

02:12.420 --> 02:14.060
Because I've heard

02:14.140 --> 02:15.140
that many women

02:15.140 --> 02:16.900
who've been to Shan'an Clinic

02:17.650 --> 02:18.580
are now being forced

02:18.580 --> 02:20.070
by their in-laws to commit suicide.

02:20.090 --> 02:21.740
So, I'm wondering

02:22.490 --> 02:24.300
if I've done the wrong thing.

02:24.740 --> 02:25.600
No, you haven't.

02:25.620 --> 02:26.460
You're feeling guilty

02:26.460 --> 02:29.180
for doing the right thing.

02:30.980 --> 02:32.620
Chief, since you want

02:32.620 --> 02:33.530
to win Miss Si's favor,

02:33.530 --> 02:35.880
why invite Mr. Zhen here?

02:35.900 --> 02:37.230
Now, look.

02:37.250 --> 02:38.930
You've been helping her all the way,

02:38.950 --> 02:39.810
but it's Mr. Zhen

02:39.810 --> 02:41.970
who is receiving credit for it.

02:42.250 --> 02:43.810
This is knowing her intentions

02:43.810 --> 02:45.460
and fulfilling her wishes.

02:46.580 --> 02:48.120
I've helped her after all.

02:48.140 --> 02:50.400
The rest doesn't matter.

02:50.420 --> 02:52.030
If that's the case,

02:52.050 --> 02:53.620
why did you send me out

02:53.700 --> 02:55.310
on a long journey so late

02:55.320 --> 02:56.650
just to buy these cherry preserves

02:56.650 --> 02:58.180
for Miss Jiang?

02:58.180 --> 02:59.540
This...

03:02.180 --> 03:03.400
Don't overthink.

03:03.420 --> 03:04.680
It's not your fault.

03:04.700 --> 03:06.060
You're very brave.

03:08.210 --> 03:09.570
Excuse me.

03:10.620 --> 03:13.020
Mr. Zhen, you must be tired

03:13.020 --> 03:14.350
after such a long journey.

03:14.370 --> 03:16.160
Would you like to try this?

03:16.180 --> 03:17.210
I don't like sweets.

03:17.210 --> 03:18.570
I see.

03:19.250 --> 03:20.610
Miss Jiang,

03:20.930 --> 03:22.930
try some cherry preserves.

03:30.490 --> 03:33.070
You're good at cheering people up.

03:33.090 --> 03:34.070
As soon as you arrived,

03:34.090 --> 03:35.470
Miss Jiang was immediately happy.

03:35.490 --> 03:36.330
Yes, yes.

03:36.340 --> 03:37.720
How is it? Is it sweet?

03:37.740 --> 03:38.580
Yes.

03:38.580 --> 03:39.750
How does Mr. Yu know

03:39.770 --> 03:40.980
I like cherry preserves?

03:40.980 --> 03:43.810
I guess that you'd like them.

03:45.330 --> 03:48.740
I had a long journey
to buy them for you.

03:49.210 --> 03:50.050
Thank you.

03:50.050 --> 03:51.410
Another one?

03:56.300 --> 03:58.910
Mr. Yu, maybe I should try...

03:58.930 --> 04:00.230
Mr. Zhen,

04:00.250 --> 04:02.000
I almost forgot to tell you this.

04:02.020 --> 04:03.650
You should hurry back and pack.

04:03.650 --> 04:05.370
You'll leave
for Capital Security tomorrow.

04:05.370 --> 04:06.690
Jiang has entrusted me

04:06.690 --> 04:08.940
to escort Miss Jiang.

04:09.820 --> 04:10.660
So soon?

04:10.660 --> 04:12.170
You have official duties.

04:12.660 --> 04:14.410
Miss Jiang, have another one?

04:14.780 --> 04:16.410
Let Mr. Zhen have one.

04:17.050 --> 04:19.090
He said he doesn't like sweets.

04:38.220 --> 04:39.320
Mr. Yu,

04:39.340 --> 04:41.410
we're approaching Cloud Peak.

04:41.810 --> 04:43.540
The Cloud Temple on top of the peak

04:43.540 --> 04:45.220
has always been popular.

04:45.300 --> 04:47.720
People in Lingshui love
to come here to make wishes.

04:47.740 --> 04:49.100
Really?

04:50.420 --> 04:52.690
My sister comes here every year
to make a wish

04:52.690 --> 04:53.670
and give thanks.

04:53.690 --> 04:55.280
She's probably here today too.

04:55.300 --> 04:56.660
Let's go and see.

05:05.440 --> 05:09.920
(Cloud Temple, Lingshui)

05:57.320 --> 06:01.320
(Mrs. Zhu)

06:07.420 --> 06:09.230
We're just here to offer incense,

06:09.250 --> 06:10.420
but she kowtows

06:10.420 --> 06:12.090
and recites scriptures.

06:12.250 --> 06:13.610
If outsiders see her,

06:13.690 --> 06:16.140
they'll surely gossip about me.

06:16.420 --> 06:17.520
Mother,

06:17.540 --> 06:18.810
Yi's been fasting for three days

06:18.810 --> 06:20.700
for this prayer.

06:22.130 --> 06:23.750
The reason why she's sincere

06:24.100 --> 06:25.100
is to give our family

06:25.100 --> 06:26.010
a grandson.

06:26.010 --> 06:27.610
What's the use of it?

06:27.890 --> 06:30.260
We've tried many ways over the years.

06:30.370 --> 06:31.540
She's drunk incense ashes,

06:31.540 --> 06:32.970
and we've used realgar,

06:33.180 --> 06:34.650
but still, nothing.

06:34.860 --> 06:35.700
Mother.

06:35.710 --> 06:37.900
Enough. You're the only one
protecting her.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.350
If she had only given someone else

06:39.370 --> 06:41.160
a daughter after seven years,

06:41.180 --> 06:43.020
she'd have been sent home by now.

07:00.740 --> 07:02.550
I'm Jiang Yi, a devout woman.

07:02.570 --> 07:04.780
The son-bearing immortal,

07:04.980 --> 07:06.960
please let me have a boy

07:06.980 --> 07:09.940
to continue the family line.

07:10.180 --> 07:12.650
I'm willing to live a life
of cultivation,

07:12.690 --> 07:14.820
abstaining from meat and alcohol,

07:14.860 --> 07:17.580
eliminating greed,
and rejecting pleasure.

07:45.100 --> 07:47.090
Ziyu, come back here.

07:55.340 --> 07:56.700
Yi.

07:59.180 --> 08:00.540
Yi.

08:00.930 --> 08:02.290
Yi.

08:27.860 --> 08:29.740
Mother, Yi fainted.

08:29.740 --> 08:31.610
We must send her to the clinic.

08:33.370 --> 08:34.960
What should we do now?

08:34.980 --> 08:37.250
The clinic is far from here.

08:37.550 --> 08:39.210
What happened to my sister?

08:42.060 --> 08:44.060
Who is this wild girl?

08:45.060 --> 08:47.340
She's Jiang Yi's sister, Jiang Si.

08:48.170 --> 08:49.290
What happened to my sister?

08:49.290 --> 08:51.180
She fainted from the heat.

08:51.700 --> 08:53.060
Yi.

08:53.740 --> 08:54.680
Yi.

08:54.700 --> 08:55.700
What happened?

08:55.700 --> 08:57.060
Yi...

08:58.370 --> 08:59.940
- Yi, are you okay?
- Si.

08:59.940 --> 09:01.460
Why are you here?

09:01.860 --> 09:03.250
Honey, put me down.

09:03.250 --> 09:04.820
- Let's send Yi to the clinic.
- Sure.

09:04.820 --> 09:05.990
Si,

09:06.010 --> 09:07.080
I'm fine.

09:07.100 --> 09:08.320
Yi, are you okay?

09:08.340 --> 09:09.700
I'm fine.

09:12.740 --> 09:14.100
Mother,

09:14.490 --> 09:15.960
sorry

09:15.980 --> 09:17.660
for worrying you.

09:17.700 --> 09:19.170
Seeing you look sickly like this

09:19.170 --> 09:20.440
makes me uneasy.

09:20.460 --> 09:22.600
Go take another carriage.

09:22.620 --> 09:24.590
Don't keep wandering in front of me.

09:24.820 --> 09:27.540
As you wish, Mother.

09:27.740 --> 09:29.760
Yi, sorry for the trouble.

09:29.780 --> 09:31.350
I'll sit in the carriage with you.

09:31.370 --> 09:32.730
Ziyu,

09:32.770 --> 09:33.990
get on my carriage.

09:34.010 --> 09:35.270
We need to talk.

09:35.290 --> 09:38.250
Mother, I want to ride with Yi.

09:38.650 --> 09:40.510
She has her sister with her.

09:40.530 --> 09:42.340
Do you need to worry about her?

09:42.770 --> 09:44.130
Let's return home.

09:45.490 --> 09:48.060
Ziyu, hurry up.

09:48.250 --> 09:49.270
I'm fine.

09:49.290 --> 09:50.750
You go with Mother.

09:50.770 --> 09:51.770
I have my sister with me.

09:51.770 --> 09:53.130
It's fine.

09:55.820 --> 09:57.220
Thank you, Si.

09:59.700 --> 10:01.110
Yi, how are you?

10:01.130 --> 10:02.490
Let me take a look.

10:08.650 --> 10:10.010
It must hurt a lot.

10:33.770 --> 10:35.540
Does it hurt, Yi?

10:36.220 --> 10:37.580
It's nothing.

10:39.010 --> 10:40.630
Yi, with your current condition,

10:40.650 --> 10:42.540
I can't feel at ease.

10:43.890 --> 10:45.490
Don't worry.

10:45.580 --> 10:46.890
You saw it earlier.

10:46.890 --> 10:48.490
Your brother-in-law treats me very well.

10:48.490 --> 10:49.620
If he truly cared about you,

10:49.620 --> 10:51.610
why would he let you...

10:54.620 --> 10:56.120
By the way, where is Zhan?

10:56.140 --> 10:58.810
Aren't you supposed
to worship the ancestors together?

11:00.130 --> 11:02.150
We were traveling together,

11:02.170 --> 11:04.080
but then we were delayed.

11:04.100 --> 11:06.200
He had to report
to the Imperial Insignia Guard,

11:06.220 --> 11:08.070
so he's headed back to Ling'an.

11:10.490 --> 11:11.780
I was so worried

11:11.780 --> 11:13.520
when I heard he was in trouble.

11:14.220 --> 11:15.820
Only when I got your letter,

11:15.820 --> 11:17.350
saying he was safe,

11:17.370 --> 11:18.850
could I feel relieved.

11:20.100 --> 11:21.530
However, after all this,

11:21.530 --> 11:22.750
it's a blessing

11:22.770 --> 11:24.770
that he can start anew.

11:50.970 --> 11:52.270
What's wrong with the carriage?

11:52.290 --> 11:53.130
What happened?

11:53.130 --> 11:53.980
Yi, hold on tight.

11:53.980 --> 11:55.340
OK.

11:58.100 --> 12:00.220
Miss! Hurry and catch up.

12:03.820 --> 12:05.180
What's that sound?

12:05.290 --> 12:07.250
Turn around and catch up.

12:07.770 --> 12:09.130
Coachman.

12:16.250 --> 12:18.060
- Be careful.
- Be careful, Si.

12:24.130 --> 12:26.300
- Help.
- Help.

12:38.290 --> 12:39.650
Coachman...

13:27.960 --> 13:32.560
(Xie Yinlou, Captain of Lingshui)

13:39.700 --> 13:40.720
Are you alright?

13:40.740 --> 13:42.060
- I'm fine.
- Are you injured?

13:42.060 --> 13:44.090
- I'm fine.
- Here, Yi.

13:50.980 --> 13:51.820
Are you okay, Yi?

13:51.820 --> 13:53.180
I'm fine.

13:54.130 --> 13:55.440
Thank you, sir.

13:55.460 --> 13:56.820
My pleasure.

14:00.060 --> 14:01.040
Miss!

14:01.060 --> 14:02.420
Chief!

14:03.770 --> 14:04.610
It's alright.

14:04.610 --> 14:05.600
Miss, are you alright?

14:05.620 --> 14:06.980
I'm fine.

14:07.740 --> 14:09.100
I'm fine.

14:11.820 --> 14:14.250
Yinlou, it's you.

14:14.460 --> 14:15.630
Miss Jiang Si,

14:15.650 --> 14:16.960
what brings you to Lingshui?

14:16.980 --> 14:18.440
I came to visit my sister.

14:18.460 --> 14:20.630
It's been so many years
since we last met.

14:20.650 --> 14:21.720
How come you're here?

14:21.740 --> 14:22.990
Miss, you may not know this.

14:23.010 --> 14:24.220
I've been a Captain in Lingshui

14:24.220 --> 14:25.660
for several years now.

14:26.650 --> 14:27.920
Thank you, Yinlou,

14:27.940 --> 14:29.230
for saving us earlier.

14:29.250 --> 14:30.610
My pleasure.

14:30.940 --> 14:32.870
Yi, this is Yinlou.

14:32.890 --> 14:34.980
He lived with us at home
when we were young.

14:34.980 --> 14:36.340
Remember?

14:38.060 --> 14:40.180
Thank you for saving us, Captain.

14:42.170 --> 14:44.970
Thank you, Mr. Xie, Mr. Yu.

14:45.170 --> 14:47.130
If it weren't for you two,

14:47.890 --> 14:49.470
Yi and Si would've been

14:49.490 --> 14:51.110
in danger.

14:51.130 --> 14:52.660
Mr. Zhu, it's nothing.

14:57.940 --> 15:00.110
Captain Xie, you're remarkable.

15:00.130 --> 15:01.150
I admire you.

15:01.170 --> 15:02.230
You flatter me.

15:02.250 --> 15:04.110
It was you who turned the tide.

15:04.130 --> 15:05.960
You're both skilled and brave.

15:05.980 --> 15:07.720
You risked your life to protect them.

15:07.740 --> 15:08.920
I admire you.

15:08.940 --> 15:11.180
Let's stop flattering each other.

15:11.260 --> 15:13.020
It's not easy for either of us.

15:13.740 --> 15:15.770
Ziyu, since she's fine,

15:15.770 --> 15:17.730
let's hurry back home.

15:20.060 --> 15:21.320
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

15:21.340 --> 15:23.010
I will remember your kindness

15:23.460 --> 15:25.540
and will visit you for this another day.

15:26.250 --> 15:27.610
Goodbye.

15:30.220 --> 15:32.150
Yi, you should go back with Ziyu.

15:32.170 --> 15:34.200
I'll stay with Aman and Mr. Yu.

15:34.220 --> 15:35.970
Sure, see you later.

15:36.700 --> 15:39.060
Ziyu, take care of my sister.

15:40.250 --> 15:41.610
Don't worry.

15:57.620 --> 15:59.270
I feel that the horse being startled

15:59.290 --> 16:00.680
is definitely not an accident.

16:00.700 --> 16:02.910
How could a horse
suddenly get scared?

16:03.100 --> 16:04.230
I believe someone

16:04.250 --> 16:05.510
tried to harm my sister.

16:05.530 --> 16:06.440
Harm her?

16:06.460 --> 16:07.960
- Yes.
- Who do you think it is?

16:07.980 --> 16:09.490
I think it's Mrs. Zhu.

16:10.400 --> 16:11.290
She insisted

16:11.290 --> 16:13.420
that my sister take this carriage today.

16:13.980 --> 16:15.800
My sister used to write to me

16:15.820 --> 16:17.650
and tell me how well she was doing

16:17.650 --> 16:19.300
with the Zhu family.

16:19.530 --> 16:21.390
But I've seen it with my eyes.

16:21.410 --> 16:24.260
Now, I know that Mrs. Zhu
has been bullying her like that.

16:24.290 --> 16:26.300
I feel so bad about it.

16:27.770 --> 16:29.040
Whoever it is,

16:29.060 --> 16:31.570
I'll stay and help you investigate
before leaving.

16:35.250 --> 16:36.090
Alright.

16:36.090 --> 16:38.640
(Jiang)

16:44.940 --> 16:47.370
Young Master, the time is almost up.

16:49.340 --> 16:52.130
Zhan, still practicing?

16:52.530 --> 16:53.890
Come here.

16:54.860 --> 16:56.570
Come here now.

17:00.620 --> 17:02.210
You've worked so hard.

17:02.210 --> 17:03.760
It makes me feel bad for you.

17:03.780 --> 17:05.040
Sit down.

17:05.060 --> 17:07.220
Look what I've brought for you.

17:08.620 --> 17:09.800
Sit and rest.

17:09.820 --> 17:11.180
Have some tea.

17:14.170 --> 17:17.630
Have some tea to soothe your throat.

17:17.650 --> 17:19.010
Thank you, Aunt Xiao.

17:19.130 --> 17:20.810
Don't stand on ceremony.

17:21.370 --> 17:24.460
We're family, no need for formalities.

17:33.210 --> 17:34.810
You've changed.

17:34.860 --> 17:36.700
You've really changed.

17:37.060 --> 17:39.150
Since you joined
the Imperial Insignia Guard,

17:39.170 --> 17:40.670
you've changed completely.

17:40.690 --> 17:42.200
You're doing so well now.

17:42.410 --> 17:44.000
That's great.

17:44.020 --> 17:44.890
You're going

17:44.890 --> 17:46.300
to work in the court,

17:46.300 --> 17:47.340
and you and your uncle

17:47.340 --> 17:49.700
will be able to support each other.

17:51.650 --> 17:53.010
Aunt Xiao,

17:53.370 --> 17:54.650
Uncle Anmou is

17:54.650 --> 17:56.280
an official of the court.

17:56.300 --> 17:58.110
I'm just a minor guard.

17:58.130 --> 17:59.240
I can't support him.

17:59.260 --> 18:00.500
Good heavens.

18:00.500 --> 18:01.710
What are you saying?

18:01.730 --> 18:04.040
What a minor guard?

18:04.060 --> 18:05.240
You are currently serving

18:05.260 --> 18:07.870
by the Emperor's side.

18:07.890 --> 18:09.950
If you serve the Emperor well,

18:09.970 --> 18:12.330
you could even become a personal guard.

18:13.300 --> 18:15.420
You know even more than I do.

18:19.210 --> 18:22.040
Zhan, I'm genuinely happy
that you've become

18:22.060 --> 18:24.390
an Imperial Insignia Guard.

18:24.410 --> 18:25.770
Clearly.

18:26.500 --> 18:28.000
Sometimes there will

18:28.020 --> 18:29.600
inevitably be competition

18:29.620 --> 18:31.250
between our two branches,

18:31.300 --> 18:33.800
but outside of the family,

18:33.820 --> 18:36.190
we are all of the same root,

18:36.210 --> 18:37.670
sharing both honor and disgrace.

18:37.690 --> 18:39.870
We're all the Jiangs.

18:39.890 --> 18:41.250
Yes,

18:42.060 --> 18:43.420
and no.

18:43.580 --> 18:45.010
How can it not be?

18:45.890 --> 18:47.350
A family

18:47.370 --> 18:49.770
should share both honor and disgrace,

18:50.020 --> 18:53.940
not kick someone when they're down.

19:02.450 --> 19:04.100
Now that you're a Guard,

19:04.340 --> 19:06.330
you're talking differently.

19:08.060 --> 19:09.910
I didn't ask you to do it

19:09.930 --> 19:12.770
only for your uncle's sake.

19:14.410 --> 19:15.630
It's also for your future.

19:15.650 --> 19:17.560
You're too young to know this.

19:17.580 --> 19:19.190
For an official in the court,

19:19.210 --> 19:20.910
it's almost impossible

19:20.930 --> 19:23.010
to get anywhere without any backing.

19:23.970 --> 19:25.190
You're right.

19:25.210 --> 19:26.860
But look.

19:26.930 --> 19:29.290
For an Imperial Insignia Guard,

19:29.340 --> 19:30.710
I think I need to rely on myself,

19:30.730 --> 19:32.240
not anyone else,

19:32.260 --> 19:34.970
so I won't become someone else's pawn.

19:40.540 --> 19:43.320
Zhan, if you don't know
what's good for you,

19:43.340 --> 19:46.380
you'll end up falling into trouble.

19:46.410 --> 19:48.000
You're absolutely right.

19:48.020 --> 19:49.300
I need to practice,

19:49.320 --> 19:50.710
or I'll easily fall into trouble.

19:50.730 --> 19:52.090
Let's go practice.

19:54.100 --> 19:55.210
I don't believe

19:55.210 --> 19:57.180
you'll always be lucky.

19:57.500 --> 19:58.860
What did you say?

20:01.620 --> 20:03.280
I said you're practicing well.

20:03.300 --> 20:04.860
Then I'll practice harder.

20:05.020 --> 20:06.810
You're so strong.

20:35.330 --> 20:37.060
♪ From place to place ♪

20:37.060 --> 20:42.000
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

20:42.370 --> 20:44.750
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

20:44.750 --> 20:48.980
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

20:49.690 --> 20:52.090
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

20:52.110 --> 20:55.060
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall
and take root ♪

20:55.060 --> 20:56.420
Miss Si.

20:57.820 --> 20:58.840
Has Yu Qi

20:58.860 --> 21:00.570
seen your dark side?

21:00.820 --> 21:02.670
Does he know everything about you?

21:04.730 --> 21:05.680
Yes.

21:05.700 --> 21:09.080
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

21:09.100 --> 21:10.940
(If you truly love someone, )

21:13.300 --> 21:14.900
(you should let her go)

21:16.100 --> 21:17.460
(and wish her well.)

21:19.940 --> 21:24.500
♪ And stars ♪

21:27.640 --> 21:31.080
(Zhu Mansion, Lingshui)

21:31.100 --> 21:32.940
Ma'am, we found the horse.

21:34.060 --> 21:36.010
This useless beast

21:36.170 --> 21:38.050
almost caused a disaster.

21:38.300 --> 21:40.540
Go have it slaughtered.

21:40.560 --> 21:42.150
- Yes.
- Mother.

21:42.170 --> 21:43.710
It's a life.

21:43.730 --> 21:45.240
We just worshiped the God of Trees.

21:45.260 --> 21:46.670
We can't kill it now.

21:46.690 --> 21:48.110
I told you to go, didn't I?

21:48.130 --> 21:49.490
Yes.

21:52.450 --> 21:53.810
Wait a moment.

21:55.930 --> 21:57.800
This hasn't been clarified yet.

21:57.820 --> 21:59.630
Why in such a hurry to kill the horse?

21:59.650 --> 22:01.220
What's there to clarify?

22:01.650 --> 22:02.620
Isn't it obvious

22:02.620 --> 22:04.460
that this beast suddenly went mad?

22:04.500 --> 22:06.040
It makes me furious by looking at it.

22:06.060 --> 22:08.470
It won't be needed anymore,

22:08.650 --> 22:10.110
so why not kill it?

22:10.130 --> 22:11.940
If I remember correctly,

22:12.260 --> 22:14.580
the carriage I rode in with my sister

22:15.370 --> 22:17.370
was rented by you, right?

22:17.540 --> 22:18.910
How could I have known

22:18.930 --> 22:19.880
that this beast

22:19.890 --> 22:21.210
couldn't even handle

22:21.210 --> 22:22.150
such a small task?

22:22.170 --> 22:23.620
Was it unexpected,

22:23.780 --> 22:26.160
or are you in a hurry
to destroy the evidence?

22:27.540 --> 22:28.900
Me?

22:29.170 --> 22:30.670
What do you mean by that?

22:30.690 --> 22:32.190
Go ahead and tell me.

22:32.210 --> 22:33.370
What crime have I committed?

22:33.370 --> 22:36.620
You wanted to kill your daughter-in-law
in this accident.

22:37.890 --> 22:39.250
You...

22:39.650 --> 22:41.010
Mother.

22:41.780 --> 22:43.140
Yi.

22:43.340 --> 22:45.840
I paid money to rent the carriage,

22:45.860 --> 22:47.810
and now it has become my crime.

22:47.860 --> 22:49.350
Don't be angry, Mother.

22:49.580 --> 22:52.240
Captain Xie must've seen
many dangers in the army,

22:52.260 --> 22:54.140
so he's suspicious of this.

22:55.860 --> 22:57.220
Yes, Mother.

22:57.540 --> 23:00.810
Yi would never think like that.

23:07.340 --> 23:08.700
Miss Si,

23:08.860 --> 23:10.420
what do you mean by this?

23:13.170 --> 23:14.530
Yi,

23:14.820 --> 23:17.100
do you think I would harm you?

23:21.410 --> 23:22.770
Fine.

23:23.020 --> 23:24.700
I really didn't expect

23:24.860 --> 23:26.580
that in your eyes,

23:26.730 --> 23:28.940
I'm so cruel.

23:33.780 --> 23:35.770
Yi, don't worry.

23:38.410 --> 23:39.770
Mother.

23:40.970 --> 23:42.190
Miss Jiang,

23:42.210 --> 23:43.760
I'm going with Mr. Yu and Long Dan

23:43.780 --> 23:45.190
to investigate the coachman.

23:45.210 --> 23:46.570
Thank you, Captain.

23:51.930 --> 23:53.730
How unlucky.

23:53.730 --> 23:54.870
I lost the carriage

23:54.890 --> 23:56.530
and got into trouble.

23:56.620 --> 23:58.320
The coachman came three days ago.

23:58.340 --> 24:00.190
His accent shows he's not local.

24:00.210 --> 24:01.970
He said he fled here from the west.

24:01.970 --> 24:03.260
His family's all dead.

24:03.260 --> 24:04.210
I felt sorry for him,

24:04.210 --> 24:05.860
so I kept him.

24:06.500 --> 24:08.040
The Zhu family is distinguished.

24:08.060 --> 24:08.970
Why use a newcomer?

24:08.970 --> 24:10.390
It was a coincidence.

24:10.410 --> 24:12.280
This morning, everyone had a stomachache

24:12.300 --> 24:13.520
because of some food,

24:13.540 --> 24:15.530
and only he came late, so...

24:17.820 --> 24:19.620
Could it all be part of the plan?

24:21.730 --> 24:22.770
Captain Xie,

24:22.790 --> 24:23.930
we're from the same hometown.

24:23.930 --> 24:25.150
You know me well.

24:25.170 --> 24:27.330
I'm just a simple businessman.

24:27.820 --> 24:29.180
Captain Xie.

24:41.260 --> 24:42.430
Yi,

24:42.450 --> 24:44.480
why still copy scriptures for Mrs. Zhu

24:44.580 --> 24:46.420
after she treated you badly?

24:48.730 --> 24:50.730
I defied her today.

24:50.860 --> 24:51.950
I should apologize

24:51.970 --> 24:53.460
and give her a way out.

24:54.020 --> 24:55.280
But...

24:55.300 --> 24:57.180
Don't you suspect her?

24:58.410 --> 25:00.180
My mother-in-law
isn't satisfied with me,

25:00.200 --> 25:01.320
but she wouldn't go so far.

25:01.340 --> 25:03.130
This incident concerns your life.

25:03.130 --> 25:04.600
It can't be taken lightly.

25:04.620 --> 25:06.280
If it weren't for Mr. Xie and Mr. Yu,

25:06.300 --> 25:07.860
it would've been terrible.

25:08.260 --> 25:09.900
But nothing happened to me.

25:10.650 --> 25:12.540
It was probably just an accident.

25:12.540 --> 25:13.710
Think about it.

25:13.730 --> 25:14.650
The horse was startled,

25:14.650 --> 25:16.210
and the coachman jumped off at once.

25:16.230 --> 25:17.930
It must be premeditated.

25:18.730 --> 25:20.760
The coachman is just a stranger.

25:20.780 --> 25:22.500
Why would he harm me for no reason?

25:22.500 --> 25:24.630
Yi, stop trying to deceive yourself.

25:24.650 --> 25:27.010
Mrs. Zhu rented this carriage for you.

25:27.030 --> 25:28.100
When Ziyu wanted to get on,

25:28.100 --> 25:29.000
she stopped him.

25:29.010 --> 25:30.650
And she was eager to kill the horse now.

25:30.650 --> 25:32.050
Alright, Si.

25:32.300 --> 25:34.040
I know you're worried about me,

25:34.060 --> 25:36.730
but we can't guess wildly
without evidence.

25:38.930 --> 25:40.600
I don't want to hurt

25:40.620 --> 25:42.460
my family's feelings over this.

25:46.170 --> 25:48.140
I found you really changed

25:48.210 --> 25:51.000
during this visit.

25:51.020 --> 25:52.280
In the past,

25:52.300 --> 25:54.320
you were always cautious,

25:54.340 --> 25:55.770
but now...

25:57.500 --> 25:59.280
I'm afraid your assertive actions

25:59.300 --> 26:00.600
will lead you to trouble.

26:00.620 --> 26:02.190
How could I suffer?

26:02.210 --> 26:03.650
When we were at home,

26:03.650 --> 26:05.150
we endured everything,

26:05.170 --> 26:07.280
but how did the second branch treat us?

26:07.300 --> 26:08.610
Now I've realized

26:08.630 --> 26:10.210
that we have to stand up for ourselves,

26:10.210 --> 26:12.180
or we'll always be bullied.

26:14.450 --> 26:16.190
It's good that you think this way,

26:16.210 --> 26:17.600
so I don't have to worry

26:17.620 --> 26:19.240
about whether you're doing well at home

26:19.260 --> 26:21.210
and whether someone is bullying you.

26:21.730 --> 26:23.530
You've really grown up.

26:24.580 --> 26:26.800
Yi, don't worry about me.

26:26.820 --> 26:28.240
You should think carefully

26:28.260 --> 26:30.140
about what happened today.

26:45.500 --> 26:47.220
Let me see your hand.

26:53.370 --> 26:55.070
Don't copy scriptures anymore.

26:55.820 --> 26:57.180
I'm fine.

27:02.340 --> 27:03.790
Chief, after Mr. Chu left

27:03.790 --> 27:04.930
the Directorate of Astronomy,

27:04.930 --> 27:06.110
he came to Lingshui.

27:06.130 --> 27:07.800
Mr. Chu is at the tavern ahead.

27:07.820 --> 27:08.710
What about Mr. Xiao?

27:08.730 --> 27:09.570
He went mad.

27:09.580 --> 27:10.710
- Mad?
- Yes.

27:10.730 --> 27:12.120
I heard that after his resignation,

27:12.120 --> 27:12.670
he went mad.

27:12.690 --> 27:15.130
It's said it's because of the death
of his wife.

27:15.130 --> 27:16.670
It's been several years.

27:16.730 --> 27:18.930
Alright, we'll go meet

27:18.930 --> 27:20.460
with Mr. Chu.

27:26.620 --> 27:27.320
Chief,

27:27.340 --> 27:28.540
the one sleeping on the table

27:28.540 --> 27:29.900
is Mr. Chu.

27:52.130 --> 27:53.240
What's going on?

27:53.260 --> 27:54.620
Give it back to me.

27:55.370 --> 27:56.730
What happened

27:57.500 --> 27:59.110
to the Top Scholar?

27:59.130 --> 28:03.520
There's a great world in the drinks.

28:03.540 --> 28:05.150
You used to do well

28:05.170 --> 28:06.710
in the Directorate of Astronomy.

28:06.730 --> 28:08.020
Why did you voluntarily transfer

28:08.020 --> 28:09.350
to this small place?

28:09.370 --> 28:12.280
My mother was seriously ill back then,

28:12.300 --> 28:15.190
so I returned home to take care of her.

28:15.210 --> 28:17.170
What does that have to do with you?

28:17.170 --> 28:19.200
Let's talk about something pertinent.

28:20.210 --> 28:23.140
The 5th day of the 5th month,
3rd year of Jingming.

28:27.170 --> 28:28.320
You...

28:28.340 --> 28:29.900
Who are you?

28:30.260 --> 28:31.560
I don't know anything.

28:31.580 --> 28:32.480
Don't ask me.

28:32.500 --> 28:33.340
Don't ask me.

28:33.340 --> 28:35.000
Was the unlucky fate of the 7th Prince

28:35.020 --> 28:36.860
suggested by you?

28:36.860 --> 28:38.020
The 7th Prince?

28:38.020 --> 28:39.210
Didn't you say

28:39.210 --> 28:40.180
it's over

28:40.200 --> 28:41.210
and you won't pressure me?

28:41.210 --> 28:42.930
Since we're here today,

28:42.930 --> 28:44.060
you have to speak,

28:44.060 --> 28:45.230
whether you want to or not.

28:45.250 --> 28:46.500
I only submitted the petition.

28:46.500 --> 28:48.100
I have nothing to do with anything else.

28:48.120 --> 28:49.480
Are you trying to kill me?

28:49.500 --> 28:50.500
What else do you want?

28:50.500 --> 28:51.480
I don't know.

28:51.500 --> 28:52.500
Stop asking me.

28:52.500 --> 28:53.410
Don't ask me.

28:53.410 --> 28:54.770
Stop.

28:54.930 --> 28:56.290
I don't know.

28:56.540 --> 28:57.430
Chief.

28:57.450 --> 28:58.810
Forget it.

28:59.060 --> 29:00.570
This is enough.

29:03.320 --> 29:07.520
(Zhu Mansion)

29:07.540 --> 29:09.290
You're about to leave, right?

29:09.930 --> 29:12.390
Yi and I are going to pay respects
to our ancestors.

29:12.410 --> 29:14.240
So, I'm driving the carriage.

29:14.260 --> 29:16.150
How could I let you drive the carriage?

29:16.170 --> 29:17.040
It's okay.

29:17.060 --> 29:18.530
I'm idle anyway.

29:20.690 --> 29:22.530
Thank you, Commandant Yu.

29:27.450 --> 29:28.810
Si.

29:39.020 --> 29:40.380
Yi.

29:41.620 --> 29:42.870
Honey.

29:42.890 --> 29:44.230
Don't you have a poetry gathering

29:44.240 --> 29:45.810
with Mr. Wang?

29:46.340 --> 29:47.300
After thinking it over,

29:47.300 --> 29:48.860
I still couldn't relax.

29:48.970 --> 29:50.020
You just escaped danger.

29:50.020 --> 29:52.250
How could I go to a poetry gathering?

29:52.370 --> 29:54.700
Today, I'm driving the carriage.

29:54.860 --> 29:56.220
Thank you, honey.

30:06.730 --> 30:08.480
What about me?

30:08.500 --> 30:10.060
You can ride and follow us.

30:37.650 --> 30:39.010
Si,

30:39.170 --> 30:40.900
Commandant Yu and you...

30:43.100 --> 30:44.810
What do you want to say?

30:45.820 --> 30:47.470
He's looking out for you every day

30:47.490 --> 30:49.290
and caring for you in every way.

30:49.580 --> 30:51.940
Does he have feelings for you?

30:53.260 --> 30:55.010
No, Yi.

30:55.170 --> 30:58.280
He's just worried and afraid

30:58.300 --> 31:00.080
that something might happen again.

31:00.100 --> 31:01.480
From yesterday's incident,

31:01.500 --> 31:03.380
it's clear he's a good man.

31:03.500 --> 31:05.630
If you two have mutual feelings,

31:05.650 --> 31:07.700
you should still obey the parents.

31:09.020 --> 31:10.180
Let me tell you.

31:10.200 --> 31:11.440
When it comes to relationships,

31:11.450 --> 31:13.520
you must keep your boundaries in mind.

31:28.410 --> 31:29.910
- Help.
- Stop.

31:29.930 --> 31:31.690
Help. Help.

31:31.690 --> 31:32.950
You filthy woman.

31:32.970 --> 31:35.380
- Stop.
- Help.

31:35.410 --> 31:36.770
Stop.

31:37.620 --> 31:40.220
- Help.
- Stop, you filthy woman.

31:40.240 --> 31:41.950
We just helped you
bury your dead father,

31:41.970 --> 31:43.310
and now you turn your back on us?

31:43.310 --> 31:44.540
Please, let me go.

31:44.540 --> 31:45.560
Filthy girl.

31:45.580 --> 31:47.350
You sold yourself to bury your father.

31:47.370 --> 31:48.260
The three of us

31:48.260 --> 31:49.410
bought you.

31:49.410 --> 31:50.760
You're ours now.

31:50.780 --> 31:51.860
You have to take turns

31:51.860 --> 31:52.700
being our wife.

31:52.700 --> 31:54.240
- Get her.
- Don't come near me.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.240
- Come with me.
- Help.

31:55.260 --> 31:56.430
Long Dan.

31:56.450 --> 31:57.760
Let go of me.

31:57.780 --> 31:59.140
Get up.

32:02.400 --> 32:06.040
(Qing)

32:10.890 --> 32:13.390
Miss, you look like a kind lady.

32:13.410 --> 32:14.780
Please save me.

32:14.780 --> 32:15.860
I'm willing to do anything

32:15.860 --> 32:17.380
for you.

32:17.690 --> 32:19.520
We paid ten taels of silver for her.

32:19.540 --> 32:21.110
Her deed is still with us.

32:21.130 --> 32:23.480
You're abducting a common girl.

32:23.500 --> 32:24.760
No, Miss.

32:24.780 --> 32:26.630
I'd rather die than stay with them.

32:26.650 --> 32:29.100
Please, be kind and help me.

32:32.860 --> 32:34.220
It's up to you.

32:36.620 --> 32:38.010
In that case...

32:38.210 --> 32:39.770
- You...
- Wait.

32:40.020 --> 32:41.280
Miss,

32:41.300 --> 32:42.890
did you promise to sell yourself

32:42.890 --> 32:44.490
to bury your father?

32:44.860 --> 32:46.250
Have these three men

32:46.410 --> 32:47.450
helped you

32:47.450 --> 32:49.050
bury your father?

32:49.890 --> 32:52.150
I did promise that,

32:52.170 --> 32:54.430
but I can't serve three husbands.

32:54.450 --> 32:56.350
They're just hooligans.

32:56.370 --> 32:58.100
Miss, please, save me.

32:58.100 --> 33:00.040
Please, I beg you.

33:00.060 --> 33:01.420
Aman.

33:09.500 --> 33:11.000
Here are 20 taels of silver.

33:11.020 --> 33:11.890
Give me back the deed

33:11.890 --> 33:13.250
of this young lady.

33:13.730 --> 33:14.870
This...

33:14.890 --> 33:15.910
What?

33:15.930 --> 33:18.010
Isn't 20 enough?

33:22.100 --> 33:23.860
Do you want it?
Give me a straight answer.

33:23.860 --> 33:25.860
Stop hinting at each other.

33:34.890 --> 33:36.380
Let's go.

33:38.880 --> 33:41.520
(Xu Qing'er who sold herself)

33:43.340 --> 33:44.970
Miss, here's your deed.

33:44.970 --> 33:46.080
Take it

33:46.100 --> 33:46.950
and leave.

33:46.970 --> 33:48.330
Yi.

33:50.580 --> 33:51.840
Miss,

33:51.860 --> 33:53.430
I can't repay your great kindness.

33:53.450 --> 33:54.860
I'm willing to do anything

33:54.860 --> 33:56.220
for you.

33:56.300 --> 33:57.710
If you don't want me,

33:57.730 --> 33:59.920
I'll have nowhere to go.

33:59.940 --> 34:01.000
If those hooligans

34:01.020 --> 34:02.880
come back to harass me...

34:02.900 --> 34:04.050
Miss, we've bought

34:04.050 --> 34:05.980
your deed back for you.

34:06.020 --> 34:07.460
If you have nowhere to go,

34:07.480 --> 34:09.770
- should we...
- Si, forget it.

34:09.900 --> 34:11.330
She's just scared.

34:11.500 --> 34:13.150
Miss, please take me in.

34:13.170 --> 34:14.560
I can do anything.

34:14.580 --> 34:15.460
I just need a place

34:15.460 --> 34:16.630
to stay

34:16.650 --> 34:18.310
and some food.

34:18.330 --> 34:21.250
Miss, I'll leave my deed with you.

34:21.460 --> 34:22.560
How about this?

34:22.580 --> 34:24.850
Come to Zhu Mansion tomorrow to see me.

34:25.380 --> 34:27.580
- Thank you, Miss.
- Yi.

34:28.100 --> 34:29.460
Thank you, Miss.

34:31.380 --> 34:33.360
Go investigate these people.

34:33.380 --> 34:34.740
Yes.

34:34.900 --> 34:36.900
Yi, she doesn't have a clear background.

34:36.900 --> 34:38.700
She's just a pitiful girl.

34:38.740 --> 34:40.760
It's just an extra pair of chopsticks.

34:48.020 --> 34:49.580
This is fine.

34:49.730 --> 34:51.810
You're kind and gullible.

34:51.900 --> 34:53.570
You won't feel bad this way.

35:06.850 --> 35:08.210
Si,

35:09.480 --> 35:10.580
are you still angry with me

35:10.580 --> 35:12.730
for taking in that girl?

35:13.170 --> 35:13.910
Yi,

35:13.920 --> 35:15.020
something's definitely wrong

35:15.020 --> 35:16.110
with Qing's background.

35:16.130 --> 35:17.420
What's the problem?

35:17.420 --> 35:19.290
We haven't figured out
who the coachman is,

35:19.290 --> 35:21.000
and Qing appears now.

35:21.020 --> 35:23.180
There can't be so many coincidences.

35:23.290 --> 35:24.810
I was just helping her out,

35:24.810 --> 35:26.230
giving her a chance to survive.

35:26.250 --> 35:27.460
Since we saved her,

35:27.460 --> 35:29.020
let's be kind to the end.

35:29.020 --> 35:31.020
Yi, how can you be sure

35:31.020 --> 35:33.290
that everything Qing said is true?

35:33.620 --> 35:35.580
But she has no reason

35:35.580 --> 35:37.290
to lie to me, right?

35:39.060 --> 35:40.400
Right now, I have no proof

35:40.420 --> 35:41.880
for many things.

35:41.900 --> 35:44.140
I don't want to upset you for no reason,

35:44.770 --> 35:46.230
so I'll hold off for now.

35:46.250 --> 35:47.230
But

35:47.250 --> 35:48.520
you must remember

35:48.540 --> 35:50.890
to guard against others.

35:51.730 --> 35:53.090
I know.

35:53.540 --> 35:54.560
Don't worry.

35:54.580 --> 35:55.980
(I thought it was Mrs. Zhu)

35:55.980 --> 35:57.510
(who was a threat to Yi.)

35:57.620 --> 35:58.880
(Now, it seems)

35:58.900 --> 36:01.020
(Qing is also a bit suspicious.)

36:01.580 --> 36:02.960
(Yi is kind, )

36:02.980 --> 36:04.890
(so I'll protect her.)

36:14.260 --> 36:15.100
Hurry and pack.

36:15.100 --> 36:16.150
Ma'am is waiting.

36:16.170 --> 36:17.310
Sure.

36:17.330 --> 36:18.790
We've cleared everything up.

36:18.810 --> 36:21.210
Qing did have an old father

36:21.230 --> 36:22.520
who passed away seven days ago.

36:22.540 --> 36:23.950
The whole neighborhood knows

36:23.970 --> 36:25.880
about her selling herself
to bury her father.

36:25.900 --> 36:27.690
As for the three men who bought her,

36:27.690 --> 36:29.830
they're notorious bullies
in the village.

36:29.850 --> 36:30.960
Since that day,

36:30.980 --> 36:32.730
they've disappeared.

36:33.460 --> 36:35.220
But the neighbors said

36:35.580 --> 36:37.460
they often leave home

36:37.460 --> 36:39.120
for a dozen days at a time.

36:52.770 --> 36:54.370
Don't you think

36:54.650 --> 36:56.250
those two...

37:05.940 --> 37:08.040
With your sister's temperament,

37:08.060 --> 37:10.000
she'll grant her wish

37:10.020 --> 37:11.850
and bring her into the family.

37:12.650 --> 37:14.270
This seems

37:14.290 --> 37:16.270
a bit unnecessary.

37:16.290 --> 37:17.500
I fear she won't be content

37:17.500 --> 37:19.250
with being a concubine.

37:20.940 --> 37:22.770
She may want more.

37:36.170 --> 37:37.480
Yi,

37:37.500 --> 37:39.080
we need to talk.

37:39.100 --> 37:40.730
Please don't overthink.

37:42.100 --> 37:43.890
What's the matter? Tell me.

37:46.210 --> 37:47.310
How much longer

37:47.330 --> 37:48.980
does your sister plan to stay here?

37:48.980 --> 37:50.830
When will she return to Ling'an?

37:52.380 --> 37:54.540
Do you not want my sister

37:54.540 --> 37:55.980
to stay here?

37:56.380 --> 37:58.330
I've told you not to overthink it.

37:58.850 --> 38:00.600
She's always

38:00.620 --> 38:01.690
with Commandant Yu,

38:01.690 --> 38:03.330
which might cause gossip.

38:05.810 --> 38:06.650
Also,

38:06.660 --> 38:08.020
doesn't Captain Xie have feelings

38:08.020 --> 38:09.380
for your sister?

38:10.150 --> 38:11.920
The Xie family is prominent in Lingshui.

38:11.940 --> 38:13.590
If they could connect with your family,

38:13.610 --> 38:15.100
and form an alliance with my family,

38:15.100 --> 38:16.730
it would be great.

38:16.900 --> 38:18.230
Lingshui is so small.

38:18.250 --> 38:19.560
If the gossip spreads

38:19.580 --> 38:21.150
to his family,

38:21.170 --> 38:23.410
it could ruin your sister's marriage.

38:24.650 --> 38:26.000
Honey, don't joke like that.

38:26.020 --> 38:27.380
The Xie family would never

38:27.380 --> 38:29.220
consider my family.

38:30.250 --> 38:31.290
Captain Xie is

38:31.290 --> 38:32.410
past the marriageable age,

38:32.430 --> 38:33.810
yet he hasn't married.

38:34.100 --> 38:35.630
It's been said

38:35.650 --> 38:37.290
that when he stayed at your house,

38:37.290 --> 38:39.330
he became fond of one of the girls.

38:44.620 --> 38:45.920
Captain Xie has not married

38:45.940 --> 38:48.000
because he was in mourning

38:48.020 --> 38:49.600
for his parents for three years.

38:49.620 --> 38:51.880
Why does it concern my family's girls?

38:51.900 --> 38:54.480
Outsiders can gossip,

38:54.500 --> 38:56.270
but you can't say that.

38:56.290 --> 38:57.960
The elders are strict with the girls,

38:57.980 --> 38:59.810
and they always observe the rules.

39:04.900 --> 39:07.890
Alright, I'm sorry.

39:07.980 --> 39:09.890
I know you value the reputation.

39:09.910 --> 39:12.170
I shouldn't have spoken ill
of your sister.

39:13.850 --> 39:15.210
Please don't be mad.

39:16.580 --> 39:18.730
How could I be mad at you?

39:20.900 --> 39:23.060
My sister was just anxious

39:23.060 --> 39:24.630
because of the accident,

39:24.650 --> 39:26.890
so she asked Mr. Yu to help.

39:27.210 --> 39:28.270
Besides,

39:28.290 --> 39:29.710
I've been in Lingshui for so long,

39:29.730 --> 39:31.400
and it's her first time coming to visit.

39:31.420 --> 39:33.180
How can I send her away?

39:34.500 --> 39:36.060
You're right.

39:36.210 --> 39:38.060
It was careless of me.

39:39.020 --> 39:39.900
In a few days,

39:39.900 --> 39:41.850
there will be the Water Festival

39:41.850 --> 39:43.150
here in Lingshui.

39:43.170 --> 39:45.130
It'll be a perfect chance

39:45.130 --> 39:46.270
to show Si around.

39:46.290 --> 39:47.880
To prepare for the Water Festival,

39:47.900 --> 39:49.870
you'll have to put in lots of effort

39:50.650 --> 39:52.330
as Mother is getting older.

39:52.540 --> 39:53.960
Don't say that.

39:53.980 --> 39:56.140
It's truly my duty.

40:13.720 --> 40:16.720
(Ms. Fei, Leader of Caiyun Troupe)

40:27.650 --> 40:29.270
- Good.
- Great.

40:29.290 --> 40:33.460
- Great.
- Good.

40:33.460 --> 40:35.980
Their dancing is graceful
and captivating.

40:36.540 --> 40:37.100
Look.

40:37.120 --> 40:38.920
(Yunshui Tower, Lingshui)
the dancer leading

40:38.920 --> 40:40.790
is Ms. Fei, Leader of Caiyun Troupe.

40:40.810 --> 40:42.440
This is just a warm-up.

40:42.460 --> 40:44.020
The Water Dance tonight

40:44.020 --> 40:45.930
is what she's famous for.

40:46.810 --> 40:47.810
It's said Caiyun Troupe

40:47.810 --> 40:48.690
is hard to book.

40:48.690 --> 40:49.830
It's in high demand.

40:49.850 --> 40:51.110
Yi, you're amazing.

40:51.130 --> 40:53.240
Yes, it usually needs to be booked

40:53.240 --> 40:54.460
at least six months in advance,

40:54.460 --> 40:56.230
and it's not guaranteed.

40:56.250 --> 40:57.670
I didn't expect anything,

40:57.690 --> 40:58.690
but Ms. Fei

40:58.690 --> 41:00.210
said we clicked

41:00.210 --> 41:02.020
and agreed to perform for me.

41:02.100 --> 41:04.440
Yunshui Tower is the best spot to watch.

41:04.460 --> 41:05.920
I've saved you a seat.

41:05.940 --> 41:07.540
You rarely come here,

41:07.540 --> 41:08.650
so you must enjoy the view.

41:08.650 --> 41:10.960
Yi, you don't have to do this for me.

41:10.980 --> 41:12.080
You've been so busy

41:12.100 --> 41:13.380
with the Water Festival,

41:13.380 --> 41:15.230
running around non-stop.

41:15.250 --> 41:16.560
It must be exhausting.

41:16.580 --> 41:17.440
But Si,

41:17.460 --> 41:18.500
I'm so glad you're here,

41:18.500 --> 41:20.020
helping me.

41:20.130 --> 41:22.330
Lingshui relies on water for sustenance,

41:22.330 --> 41:23.770
and the Water Festival

41:23.770 --> 41:25.320
is the biggest event here.

41:26.100 --> 41:28.580
I hope everything goes smoothly tonight.

41:30.980 --> 41:31.940
Mrs. Ziyu,

41:31.960 --> 41:33.100
Lady Zhu is calling for you.

41:33.100 --> 41:34.040
She says it's urgent.

41:34.060 --> 41:35.560
OK, I'll go right away.

41:35.580 --> 41:37.540
Yi, I'll go with you.

41:37.770 --> 41:38.670
No need.

41:38.690 --> 41:40.710
You've stayed by my side these days.

41:40.730 --> 41:42.500
I know you're worried about me,

41:42.620 --> 41:44.880
but look, I'm fine.

41:44.900 --> 41:46.480
Though Mother is hard to get along with,

41:46.500 --> 41:47.620
the Water Festival

41:47.620 --> 41:49.040
is under my control.

41:49.060 --> 41:50.960
She won't make things hard
for me tonight.

41:50.980 --> 41:52.580
Then you take care.

41:59.900 --> 42:05.620
- Great.
- Good.

42:06.460 --> 42:07.980
What's wrong?

42:08.210 --> 42:09.460
I've noticed that Qing

42:09.460 --> 42:11.480
has been working quietly,

42:11.500 --> 42:12.750
and there's nothing unusual

42:12.770 --> 42:14.660
with Zhu Ziyu.

42:14.900 --> 42:16.230
Could it be

42:16.250 --> 42:18.140
that I've misjudged her?

42:20.060 --> 42:21.960
I know you're worried about your sister,

42:21.980 --> 42:23.460
but being too tense

42:23.460 --> 42:25.220
will only backfire.

42:25.330 --> 42:27.710
Why not just relax tonight?

42:27.730 --> 42:29.090
I'm here for you.

42:38.210 --> 42:39.890
(Opera)
Phoenix Hairpin?

42:39.940 --> 42:41.080
It'll start

42:41.100 --> 42:43.000
with Phoenix Hairpin tonight?

42:43.020 --> 42:44.100
Are you accusing me

42:44.100 --> 42:46.150
in front of everyone in Lingshui

42:46.170 --> 42:47.920
of being the vile mother-in-law
in the play

42:47.940 --> 42:49.860
that is trying
to break up you and my son?

42:49.880 --> 42:54.160
(The End of Episode 17)

42:54.650 --> 42:56.380
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.380 --> 43:01.320
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.690 --> 43:04.070
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.070 --> 43:08.300
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:09.010 --> 43:11.410
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.430 --> 43:15.090
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.110 --> 43:18.530
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.680 --> 43:24.200
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:25.020 --> 43:28.700
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.700 --> 43:32.780
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:33.020 --> 43:34.760
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.780 --> 43:39.480
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.480 --> 43:43.050
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.070 --> 43:47.300
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.320 --> 43:49.100
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.100 --> 43:53.640
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.660 --> 43:58.460
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.690 --> 44:05.220
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.240 --> 44:08.860
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.880 --> 44:12.310
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.330 --> 44:16.950
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.950 --> 44:20.640
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.660 --> 44:24.750
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.860 --> 44:26.680
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.680 --> 44:31.230
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.250 --> 44:34.950
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.970 --> 44:39.130
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.310 --> 44:41.070
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.070 --> 44:45.590
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.590 --> 44:49.230
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.250 --> 44:54.920
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.610 --> 44:58.540
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.540 --> 45:06.040
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
